# SOD+A story + balloon reveal

Spec: `design/story/STORY_SPEC.md`. Reference: `design/story/SODA Story.reference.html`
(open in a browser, Review panel bottom left). Read both before touching hero or story code.

## Non-negotiables
- `components/story/engine/` ships as is. Do not rewrite, reformat or "convert to TS".
  Chapter files are verified pixel identical to the approved animatics.
- The canvas never draws the logo. `HeroLockup.tsx` path data stays verbatim; only regroup
  it into `data-reveal` parts 0 to 3.
- Canvas stays transparent. Pass `paper: () => --page-bg` and `ink: () => --hero-line`.
- Drive reveal state through refs (classList, dataset) from `onCue`. No React state that
  re-renders the hero.
- Nothing floats before its pop lands.
- Visible copy goes in `lib/copy.ts` (en, es, fr). No colons or long dashes in visible copy.
  Mark es/fr as machine drafts.
- Log every choice not in the spec in `DESIGN_DECISIONS.md`.
